    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic meets retro high-tech in <i>Nora and Frank</i>, a stylish and unsettling post-apocalyptic world where nothing is quite what it seems \u2014 and every mimic is out to get you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLIKELY ALLIES &amp; COUNTLESS ENEMIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Nora, a goblin engineer, and her new companion Frank \u2014 a mimic suitcase \u2014 as they fight through endless hordes of enemies to rescue her friends and family from a mysterious villain. Test your reflexes in this chaotic and charming auto-shooter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692480/extras/8284a6d68ca5f1e7b99cac0c65fd763a.avif?t=1754070659\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOUSEWITCHES? BANDIT GEESE?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where 1950s Americana, fantasy tropes, comic-book absurdity, and post-apocalyptic decay boil together into one strange, beautiful mess. Behind the humor and chaos lies a dark past \u2014 and maybe some answers, if you dare to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692480/extras/a7476531d80179de3f7494021b861e69.avif?t=1754070659\" width=800 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT DEADLY BASEBALL CARDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tokens and trade them for powerful (and bizarre) baseball cards that define your build. Stack devastating combos, juggle risk and reward, and keep your goblin gut full with snacks and soda. Heroes need carbs, after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692480/extras/83d401004fabf774bdf6c99dbbd64e68.avif?t=1754070659\" width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONE RUN IS NEVER ENOUGH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match levels, cards, and snacks to create a unique run every time. Break the game, melt your brain, or pull off something glorious. Celebrate the chaos \u2014 or hit retry when it all goes horribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692480/extras/79a922aae9fd7136a51635f0a1ec5a1d.avif?t=1754070659\" width=800 height=180 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic meets retro high-tech in <i>Nora and Frank</i>, a stylish and unsettling post-apocalyptic world where nothing is quite what it seems \u2014 and every mimic is out to get you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLIKELY ALLIES &amp; COUNTLESS ENEMIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Nora, a goblin engineer, and her new companion Frank \u2014 a mimic suitcase \u2014 as they fight through endless hordes of enemies to rescue her friends and family from a mysterious villain. Test your reflexes in this chaotic and charming auto-shooter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692480/extras/8284a6d68ca5f1e7b99cac0c65fd763a.avif?t=1754070659\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOUSEWITCHES? BANDIT GEESE?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where 1950s Americana, fantasy tropes, comic-book absurdity, and post-apocalyptic decay boil together into one strange, beautiful mess. Behind the humor and chaos lies a dark past \u2014 and maybe some answers, if you dare to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692480/extras/a7476531d80179de3f7494021b861e69.avif?t=1754070659\" width=800 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT DEADLY BASEBALL CARDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tokens and trade them for powerful (and bizarre) baseball cards that define your build. Stack devastating combos, juggle risk and reward, and keep your goblin gut full with snacks and soda. Heroes need carbs, after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692480/extras/83d401004fabf774bdf6c99dbbd64e68.avif?t=1754070659\" width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONE RUN IS NEVER ENOUGH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match levels, cards, and snacks to create a unique run every time. Break the game, melt your brain, or pull off something glorious. Celebrate the chaos \u2014 or hit retry when it all goes horribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692480/extras/79a922aae9fd7136a51635f0a1ec5a1d.avif?t=1754070659\" width=800 height=180 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Blast through hordes of vicious mutants and science-gone-wrong experiments to save your goblin friends in a stylish retro-magic post-apocalypse. An auto-shooter where builds are made of baseball cards and candy. What? Yeah, we\u2019re confused too!",
